Third-party data notice: dataset/mlpromise_english.json
=======================================================

This repository redistributes a copy of the English portion of the ML-Promise
dataset. The notice exists because the repository is public: anyone who clones
it receives that data from us rather than from its authors, which makes the
attribution below an obligation of the licence rather than a courtesy.


Work
----
ML-Promise: A Multilingual Dataset for Corporate Promise Verification
(English portion; released as Trainset_English.json)

Creators
--------
Yohei Seki, Hakusen Shu, Anaïs Lhuissier, Hanwool Lee, Juyeon Kang,
Min-Yuh Day, Chung-Chi Chen

Published in
------------
Proceedings of the 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language
Processing (EMNLP 2025)
https://aclanthology.org/2025.emnlp-main.1028/
https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.04473

